    "map": {
      "type": "map",
      "button": "收藏卡 ➜",
      "html": "<h2>🗺️ 比较级最高级与副词知识地图</h2><div class=\"kgrid\"><div><h3>{{b:ADV:34}} K01 比较形式</h3><p>短词常加 -er/-est：tall–taller–tallest；以 e 结尾加 -r/-st：nice–nicer–nicest；重读闭音节且末尾一个辅音字母常双写：big–bigger–biggest；辅音+y 变 i：happy–happier–happiest。较长词常用 more/most：more beautiful, most carefully。不要说 more bigger。quiet/clever 等有不止一种常见形式；不把形容词音节数当作无例外算法。</p><details><summary>K02 不规则变化</summary><p>good/well–better–best；bad/badly–worse–worst；many/much–more–most；little–less–least；far–farther/further–farthest/furthest。实际距离可见 farther 和 further；进一步的讨论常用 further。old–older–oldest 通用；elder/eldest 主要用于家庭成员，如 my elder sister，不用 elder than。</p></details></div><div><h3>{{b:ADV:34}} K03 一样与不一样</h3><p>as + 原级 + as：Sam is as fast as Leo. 一样快。not as/so + 原级 + as：Sam is not as fast as the cheetah. 没有猎豹快。less careful than 表示不如……细心。数量用 as many flags as / as much water as。倍数优先用 twice as long as 或 three times the length of，避免歧义较大的 times bigger than。</p><details><summary>K04 比较级结构</summary><p>A + 比较级 + than + B。much/even/a little 可修饰比较级：much faster；very 通常不直接修饰比较级。两者中较……的一个：the taller of the two boys。越来越……：faster and faster / more and more carefully。越……越……：The more you practise, the better you become. 差量可说 two metres taller than。</p></details></div><div><h3>{{b:ADV:34}} K05 最高级与范围</h3><p>the strongest of the three animals；the tallest animal in the park。in 常接地点或群体，of 常接列出的成员；不是简单背“in 后单数/of 后复数”。one of the best players 中 players 用复数；作主语时 One of… 后谓语通常单数。序数最高级：the second tallest animal。选择三者：Which is the tallest, the giraffe, the elephant or the zebra?</p><details><summary>K06 the 与比较对象</summary><p>our best helper / my best friend 已有物主限定，不另加 the。真正作比较的最高级作表语仍可用 the：This route is the safest. 副词最高级 the 常可省略：Biscuit searches (the) most carefully. Her bag is bigger than mine，比较包与包。组内最……可改写为 faster than any other runner / all the other runners；不能把自己与自己相比。that/those 可代替同类事物：The flags here are larger than those there.</p></details></div><div><h3>{{b:ADV:34}} K07 副词作用与位置</h3><p>方式副词说明动作怎样发生：Mia draws the line carefully. 不宜随意插在动词与宾语之间。频率副词常在实义动词前、be 后；时间地点常在句末，地点常先于时间，强调时可变。enough 修饰形容词/副词时放后：careful enough；修饰名词时放前：enough water。very/quite/really 可修饰形容词或副词；具体位置看所修饰的部分。</p><details><summary>K08 副词比较与词形</summary><p>fast–faster–fastest，hard–harder–hardest；carefully–more carefully–most carefully；well–better–best。quick→quickly；happy→happily；simple→simply；true→truly；full→fully。hard=努力地，hardly=几乎不；late=迟，lately=最近；near=近，nearly=几乎。friendly、lovely 常是形容词：用 in a friendly way 表示友好地。</p></details></div><div><h3>{{b:ADV:34}} K09 三种构词办法</h3><p>合成：foot + ball → football；派生：help + ful → helpful，un + happy → unhappy；转化：water（水，名词）→ water the flowers（浇花，动词），拼写不变。词缀帮助猜意思，但并非每个词都能随意拼接；结合句子并查词典。比较级 -er 与 runner 中“人”的 -er 作用不同。</p><details><summary>K10 本集常用词缀</summary><p>un- 不：unhappy；re- 再：rewrite；dis- 不：disagree；-ful 有……性质：helpful/useful；-less 缺少：useless；-ly 常构成副词：carefully/happily；-er 表人：runner；-ness 表状态：happiness。-ful 结尾只有一个 l。颜色和国籍等例词不是本集背诵清单；没有练过的不能标为已掌握。</p></details></div><div><h3>{{b:ADV:34}} K11 常见错误</h3><p>I am not as tall as you. 是“我没有你高”；He runs as fast as I do. 是“他和我跑得一样快”。little 的最高级写 least。most interesting 可以在某些语境表示“非常有趣”，不能由此推出所有最高级作表语都不加 the。比较可数名词数量常用 fewer flags；不可数数量用 less water。</p></div></div><p class=\"kdl\">{download}</p>"
    },
